      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly starts the process and describes the initial inventory step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, proceed to Create P.R.."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly corresponds to the first instruction to create a purchase request."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Then, move on to Create P.R.,"
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the explicitly repeated step in the source text; redundancy is preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
